      ],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A unit failure event, part of prolonged generation unavailability, prompted authorized authorities to implement a verified protective measure. The grid manager had documented multiple generator outages and a thermal load pressure situation. This preventive load reduction was a grid stabilization action to address a confirmed power deficit, preventing grid instability in the Philippines.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-1",
          "why-2",
          "how-0",
