      "fit": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Facing a systemic generation loss due to an unplanned outage and weather-induced demand surge, emergency decision-makers activated an emergency protocol. The power system operator's action, a verified protective measure, addressed a quantified capacity loss and managed the elevated blackout probability, demonstrating crisis response to a technical fault in the power grid.",
